17:["$","section","3",{"className":"db-block db-mediaprose","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"db-mediaprose-text","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"db-h2","children":"绕开城市，而不是穿城而过"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"db-prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Dhaka Bypass 沿首都东缘延伸48公里，北起加济普尔，南至纳拉扬甘杰。修建它，是为了让往返于北部工业带与南部港口之间的货运车辆不必穿越达卡。</p><p>本路实行出入控制：车辆只能在已建成的互通立交上下，所有交叉均为立体交叉。这正是它与所衔接的各条国道的区别所在，也是全线通车之后，原本需要穿城的行程得以绕城而过的原因。</p>"}}],["$","p",null,{"className":"db-actions","children":["$","$L12",null,{"href":"/zh/travel/route","className":"db-btn db-btn-secondary","children":"上下路的位置"}]}]]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"db-figure-item db-mediaprose-figure","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"db-figure db-ratio-photo","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/bypass-ex.webp","alt":"行车道上方的龙门架写着“Welcome to Dhaka Bypass Expressway”，后方是收费广场和货车","width":696,"height":408,"sizes":"(max-width: 860px) 100vw, 46vw","className":"$undefined","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","fetchPriority":"$undefined","style":{"objectPosition":"50% 50%"}}]}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":"已通车路段建成的行车道。"}]]}]]}]
18:["$","section","6",{"className":"db-block db-mediaprose db-mediaprose-left","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"db-mediaprose-text","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"db-h2","children":"已通车路段带来的改变"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"db-prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>过去必须在加济普尔排队通行的车辆，如今可以改走收费路段。对货运企业来说，这笔账不是省下多少公里，而是怠速中烧掉的燃油和司机的工时。</p><p>本走廊在政府与社会资本合作（PPP）模式下建设和运营，涵盖设计、施工、融资、运营与养护。通行费是其资金来源。</p><p class=\"db-provisional-inline\">施工期间就本项目公布过的数据——总投资、创造的就业岗位、建成的桥梁与地下通道数量、特许经营期限——在道路通车后均未重新确认。在 DBEDC 核实之前，这些数据不会在此重新发布。</p>"}}],["$","p",null,{"className":"db-actions","children":["$","$L12",null,{"href":"/zh/travel/status","className":"db-btn db-btn-secondary","children":"今日通行状况"}]}]]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"db-figure-item db-mediaprose-figure","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"db-figure db-ratio-photo","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/photo/16.webp","alt":"刚铺好的沥青路面，有人在新路面上行走","width":416,"height":312,"sizes":"(max-width: 860px) 100vw, 46vw","className":"$undefined","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","fetchPriority":"$undefined","style":{"objectPosition":"50% 50%"}}]}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":"已通车路段建成的沥青面层。"}]]}]]}]
